<overview>
<p>The Armed Forces of the Federated Suns integrate conventional infantry directly into their Regimental Combat Teams, assigning foot, mechanized, and jump platoons to work permanently alongside BattleMech and armored formations. Towing assault-class autocannon that can crack the armor of any vehicle and threaten even BattleMech limbs, these field gun crews field the heaviest direct-fire weapons available to conventional infantry.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on production date of AFFS 3067+ advanced infantry kit.  Federated Long Rifle is the classic long arm of the AFFS.
</notes>

